              "hide": [],
              "cls": [
                "FAQ"
              ],
              "type": "accordion",
              "items": [
                {
                  "title": "Why do high net-worth individuals need specialized estate planning?",
                  "html": "Larger estates often involve multiple properties, businesses, or investments. Tailored estate planning helps minimize taxes, protect wealth, and ensure smooth succession."
                },
                {
                  "title": "Can estate planning help with business succession?",
                  "html": "<p>Yes. Business succession planning ensures your company continues smoothly under chosen leadership while protecting its value for your family or beneficiaries.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "title": "How can I reduce estate taxes and protect my wealth for future generations?",
                  "html": "<p>Through strategies like trust structures, charitable giving, and customized Wills, we can help<br>preserve wealth and reduce tax burdens for your heir</p>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
